{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36862","headline":"送霅川郑员外 · 罗隐","name":"送霅川郑员外","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"明时塞诏列分麾，东拥朱轮出帝畿。\n铜虎贵提天子印，银鱼荣傍老莱衣。\n歌听茗坞春山暖，诗咏苹洲暮鸟飞。\n知有掖垣南步在，可能须待政成归。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"罗隐","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_36862.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36862","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}